       "category": "Rewards Program ",
       "position": 1.0,
       "subcategory": [
        {
         "title": "Rewards Program ",
         "questions": [
          {
           "question": "Okay, so how does Chipotle Rewards work?",
           "answer": {
            "json": [
             {
              "nodeType": "paragraph",
              "content": [
               {
                "nodeType": "text",
                "value": "Once you’re a member, you'll earn 10 points per $1 spent at Chipotle. Earn points automatically when you order in our app and on Chipotle.com or use your phone to scan your member card at the register. You can redeem your points for free menu items and more in the Rewards Exchange. Members also get to choose a birthday reward, a welcome offer, bonus reward drops, and more."
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           "isactive": false,
           "rank": 1,
           "topQuestion": false
          },
          {
           "question": "What can I redeem my points for?",
           "answer": {
            "json": [
             {
              "nodeType": "paragraph",
              "content": [
               {
                "nodeType": "text",
                "value": "Points can be exchanged for free menu items, like burritos and guac. You can also use your points to help Chipotle cultivate a better world through nonprofit donations. Visit the Rewards Exchange in the app or online to exchange your points."
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           "isactive": false,
           "rank": 5,
           "topQuestion": false
          },
          {
           "question": "Do points expire?",
           "answer": {
            "json": [
             {
              "nodeType": "paragraph",
              "content": [
               {
                "nodeType": "text",
                "value": "Points expire after 365 days of account inactivity (i.e., no qualifying purchases), unless sooner terminated as a result of your account being deactivated. However, your points won't expire as long as you keep your account active through purchases. You can track your points in the Points History section of your account."
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           "isactive": false,
           "rank": 24,
           "topQuestion": false
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
